{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DAN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"但以理書","commonName":"但以理書","title":"但以理書","order":27,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"03d6cde69622d5a4f870e0729e0a088a48f604016e3995d762d36b17ce094ebf","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DAN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DAN/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":357},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末日"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「那時，保佑你本國之民的天使長",{"noteId":32},"米迦勒必站起來，並且有大艱難，從有國以來直到此時，沒有這樣的。你本國的民中，凡名錄在冊上的，必得拯救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["睡在塵埃中的，必有多人復醒。其中有得永生的，有受羞辱永遠被憎惡的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["智慧人必發光如同天上的光；那使多人歸義的，必發光如星，直到永永遠遠。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但以理啊，你要隱藏這話，封閉這書，直到末時。必有多人來往奔跑",{"noteId":33},"，知識就必增長。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我－但以理觀看，見另有兩個人站立：一個在河這邊，一個在河那邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["有一個問那站在河水以上、穿細麻衣的說：「這奇異的事到幾時才應驗呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我聽見那站在河水以上、穿細麻衣的，向天舉起左右手，指着活到永遠的主起誓說：「要到一載、二載、半載，打破聖民權力的時候，這一切事就都應驗了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我聽見這話，卻不明白，就說：「我主啊，這些事的結局是怎樣呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他說：「但以理啊，你只管去；因為這話已經隱藏封閉，直到末時。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["必有許多人使自己清淨潔白，且被熬煉；但惡人仍必行惡，一切惡人都不明白，惟獨智慧人能明白。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["從除掉常獻的燔祭，並設立那行毀壞可憎之物的時候，必有一千二百九十日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["等到一千三百三十五日的，那人便為有福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你且去等候結局，因為你必安歇。到了末期，你必起來，享受你的福分。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":32,"caller":"-","text":"原文是大君","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":1}},{"noteId":33,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：切心研究","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DAN/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DAN/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}